{"body":"# Hash routing to named element\r\n\r\n\r\n## Description\r\n\r\nImplemented navigation to the named element via anchor element or Navlink component with href containing '#' or using NavigationManager to navigate to url containing '#'.\r\n```razor\r\n<a href=\"#test1\">Anchor to test1</a>\r\n<NavLink href=\"#test1\">NavLink to test1</NavLink>\r\n<a href=\"/counter#test2\">Anchor to test1</a>\r\n```\r\nThere are 2 scenarios:\r\n\r\n1. Scrolling to the element on the same page\r\n   * Anchor element (or NavLink component which renders as anchor) with href  starting with '#' \r\n   * Anchor with href with the same url but with changed hash\r\n   \r\n   For this scenario I changed `NavigationManager.ts` `performInternalNavigation` which is called in the method that overrides default behavior of anchor elements to handle this scenario too.\r\n\r\n3. Internal navigation\r\n   * Anchor element with href that contains '#' linking to another page\r\n   *  using NavigationManager to navigate to another page or even the same page\r\n   \r\n   For this scenario I changed `Router` `OnAfterRenderAsync` to check the url and if it contains '#' then call a js script to scroll to the element.\r\n\r\nAlso I had to change behavior of `FocusOnNavigate` component because the page would flicker - scroll to the named element and then scroll to the `FocusOnNavigate` Selector. The ts script that `FocusOnNavigate` uses now prevents scrolling when focusing on the selector.\r\n\r\n\r\nFixes #8393\r\n","files":[{"path":"src/Components/Components/src/PublicAPI.Unshipped.txt","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/Components/src/Routing/IScrollToLocationHash.cs","additions":17,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/Components/Components/src/Routing/Router.cs","additions":19,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/Components/test/Routing/RouterTest.cs","additions":9,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/Endpoints/src/DependencyInjection/RazorComponentsServiceCollectionExtensions.cs","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/Endpoints/src/DependencyInjection/UnsupportedScrollToLocationHash.cs","additions":14,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/Components/Server/src/Circuits/CircuitFactory.cs","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/Server/src/Circuits/RemoteScrollToLocationHash.cs","additions":47,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/Components/Server/src/DependencyInjection/ComponentServiceCollectionExtensions.cs","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/Shared/src/BrowserNavigationManagerInterop.cs","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/Web.JS/src/DomWrapper.ts","additions":4,"deletions":4,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/Web.JS/src/Services/NavigationManager.ts","additions":48,"deletions":4,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/WebAssembly/WebAssembly/src/Hosting/WebAssemblyHostBuilder.cs","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/WebAssembly/WebAssembly/src/Services/IInternalJSImportMethods.cs","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/WebAssembly/WebAssembly/src/Services/InternalJSImportMethods.cs","additions":6,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/WebAssembly/WebAssembly/src/Services/WebAssemblyScrollToLocationHash.cs","additions":25,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"src/Components/WebAssembly/WebAssembly/test/TestInternalJSImportMethods.cs","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/WebView/Samples/PhotinoPlatform/src/BlazorWindow.cs","additions":14,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"src/Components/WebView/Samples/PhotinoPlatform/src/PhotinoWebViewManager.cs","additions":5,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODI